 The Diagnostics Studio executes comprehensive health checks against core application subsystems, reporting structured telemetry to the administrative UI and monitoring agents:
 
-### Telemetry Subsystem Breakdown
+### Subsystem Telemetry Breakdown
 
 | Subsystem Component | Metric & Probe Target | Healthy Threshold | Degraded Condition | Remediation Action |
