-| **PostgreSQL Engine** | Latency, connection pool saturation (`pool_size`, `checked_out`) | `< 15ms`, saturation `< 75%` | Latency `> 50ms`, pool exhausted | Scale connection pool (`DB_POOL_SIZE`), tune PostgreSQL `max_connections` |
-| **Migration Consistency** | Current version vs single-head Alembic tree | `76 / 76` migrations applied | Head mismatch or split branches | Run `kanban-ctl db migrate` or verify Alembic head |
-| **Row-Level Security** | `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` status on all tables | 100% (92 of 92 tables) | Any table lacking `FORCE RLS` | Run `kanban-ctl db audit-rls` and apply missing security policies |
