-| **Realtime WebSocket Hub** | Active client connections, ping/pong frame roundtrip | Ping latency `< 50ms` | Stalled connections, high dropped frames | Inspect Caddy/reverse-proxy timeouts and client network conditions |
-| **Async Job Executor** | Active tasks, dead letter queue (DLQ) depth | DLQ depth `= 0` | DLQ depth `> 0`, executor stalled | Inspect dead-letter payloads, clear retry budgets, check worker logs |
-| **Sandboxed Runners** | Wasmtime AST compiler and nsjail container isolation | Wasmtime initialized, nsjail active | nsjail unavailable (fallback to standalone) | Check kernel namespace support (`CONFIG_USER_NS`) and cgroup limits |
